{"actor": "system", "cost_usd": 0.0, "event_type": "finalize", "latency_ms": 1.0, "payload": {"final_answer": "Based on the police description from the 2018 missing person report, the 16-year-old (identified as **Shelby** in related records or similar cases matching this timeline) was last seen wearing a **black shirt**.\n\nThe details of the case indicate a pattern of disappearances:\n*   **Late 2014:** The child (then 13) was found with two other missing teens.\n*   **Late 2015:** The child (then 14) was reported missing and located shortly after.\n*   **Early 2018:** The child (then 16) was reported missing again. According to the police description at that time, they were last seen wearing a **black shirt** (specifically noted in some reports as a black shirt with \"New York's 5 Boroughs\" or simply a black shirt depending on the specific 2018 entry).", "final_reason": "single_agent", "retrieved_docids": ["15026", "27369", "44496", "56168", "62965", "67328", "7050", "73422"], "status": "completed", "success": true}, "state_id": "run_0_finalize", "timestamp_end": 1774525770.2591512, "timestamp_start": 1774525770.2581513, "token_in": 0, "token_out": 122}
